### Spider Health Check
GET https://localhost:5001/api/spider/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Spider Status
GET https://localhost:5001/api/spider/status
Accept: application/json

###

### List All Spiders
GET https://localhost:5001/api/spider/list
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Spider Details
GET https://localhost:5001/api/spider/example-spider
Accept: application/json

###

### Start Spider
POST https://localhost:5001/api/spider/example-spider/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "options": {
    "maxConcurrency": 5,
    "maxRequests": 100,
    "timeout": "00:00:30"
  }
}

###

### Stop Spider
POST https://localhost:5001/api/spider/example-spider/stop
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Pause Spider
POST https://localhost:5001/api/spider/example-spider/pause
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Resume Spider
POST https://localhost:5001/api/spider/example-spider/resume
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Spider Statistics
GET https://localhost:5001/api/spider/example-spider/statistics
Accept: application/json

###
